{"key":"allod/suslanger","relations":[{"id":"people","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/iz","title":"Aiset-Bek","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/junofil","title":"Baluddin","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/kuzn","title":"Brother Blacksmith","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/guru","title":"Brother Blind","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/zaku","title":"Brother Faceless","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/glav","title":"Brother Khatul","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/elder","title":"Erfar the Silvertongue","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc8","title":"Fayrakh","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/karh","title":"Kardaur","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/nekro","title":"Kehel","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc7","title":"Kharad","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/oldnekro","title":"Kholai","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/nalo","title":"Odalisque","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc10","title":"Sahilia","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/spirit","title":"Spirit","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/hero","title":"Zak","variant":""}],"title":"Inhabitants"},{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/glav","title":"Brother Khatul","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/karh","title":"Kardaur","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/nalo","title":"Odalisque","variant":""}],"title":"Related characters"},{"id":"region","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/bz18h","title":"Cave - meeting place","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz15h","title":"Death canyon","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz13h","title":"Fortress","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz14h","title":"Last Shelter","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz17h","title":"Necromancers' desert","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz15h","title":"Old Necromancer's tower","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz19h","title":"Portal","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz16h","title":"Secret trading place","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz18h","title":"The city of Suslanger and its environs","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz16h","title":"Wormheads' cave","variant":""}],"title":"Locations"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Suslanger</h1><h2>Setting</h2><p>Suslanger is a dry Khadaganian allod with little cultivable land. A river, lake, dams and irrigation channels sustain its settlements. Imperial decrees are enforced by guards and informers. Beyond that order lie necromancers’ laboratories, Wormface caverns and the hidden refuge of escaped slaves. [1, 2, 3]</p><h2>The trail of At-Zako</h2><p>Zak’s arrival leads to imprisonment by <a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Kardaur</a>, escape with <a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a>’s help and shelter under <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a>. His investigation passes from a collector of Joon antiquities to necromancers and a dead scientist. Their clues reveal how the missing Joon escaped and supply the amulet that ultimately points back to Gipath. [4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original game dialogue and world descriptions. Source numbers refer to the scenes listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>World description · Suslanger (allod suslanger)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>World description · Wormheads' cave (zone gz16h)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>World description · Necromancers' desert (zone gz17h)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing kr60)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing kr61)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing gl64)</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/junofil\">Baluddin</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing jf67)</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/oldnekro\">Kholai</a> (briefing sn69)</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/spirit\">Spirit</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/oldnekro\">Kholai</a> (briefing sn69_1)</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/rick\">Tka Rik (Tka-Lithan Richti-Nik)</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing r72_1)</td></tr></table><h2>Inhabitants</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/iz\">Aiset-Bek</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/junofil\">Baluddin</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/kuzn\">Brother Blacksmith</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/guru\">Brother Blind</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/zaku\">Brother Faceless</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/elder\">Erfar the Silvertongue</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc8\">Fayrakh</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Kardaur</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/nekro\">Kehel</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc7\">Kharad</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/oldnekro\">Kholai</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Sahilia</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/spirit\">Spirit</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a></td></tr></table><h2>Related characters</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Kardaur</a>